\newlabel{fig:susceptibility}{{2}{11}{\textbf {Empirical and theoretical susceptibility.} (a) State-matched ADVOCATE-minus-NoOp response with $95\%$ bootstrap intervals and the finite-compliance calibration from microscopic transition rates. (b) Exact theory showing how kinetic compliance $\gamma $ changes the response amplitude without moving the intrinsic set point}{figure.2}{}}
