\newlabel{fig:landscapes}{{3}{12}{\textbf {State-local response and information.} (a) Empirical signed population drift as a function of target support and actuation budget at $q_c=12$. (b) Empirical state-local action-to-population information above a within-state permutation null. (c) Exact theoretical state-local information landscape for the baseline finite-bias feedback controller. (d) Number of observed rounds supporting each empirical state bin}{figure.3}{}}
